{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UL5teRFUphtGdDGGTTEVrF","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '原始framing完全成立。三贡献清晰：(1) 首次大规模temporal measurement drift实证发现，6个benchmark一致性证实泛化性；\n2\t  (2) ground truth meta-critique改变领域对web-overlap验证的认知；(3) semi-synthetic + cross-subject\n3\t  matching作为可复用基础设施。 ''31% instability robust to all controls''作为headline。DIF as diagnostic\n4\t  lens + audit protocol提供actionable价值。无需调整claims强度。\n5\t\n6\t  '\n7\timagined_experiments:\n8\t- name: real_data_dif_mmlu\n9\t  plan_id: plan_001\n10\t  description: 'METABENCH MMLU response matrix (5,219 models × 12,508 items) 上的全量DIF分析。\n11\t    temporal cohort (2023 vs 2024-H1)、ability-quintile split、within-family confound\n12\t    control、domain-specificity分析。\n13\t\n14\t    '\n15\t  expected_results:\n16\t    temporal_ets_c_pct: 31.3\n17\t    temporal_fpr_li_clean: 0.318\n18\t    temporal_enrichment: 0.96\n19\t    ability_ets_c_pct: 2.9\n20\t    ability_enrichment: 1.19\n21\t    within_family_llama2v3_c_pct: 61.3\n22\t    within_family_mistral_mixtral_c_pct: 38.7\n23\t    domain_spearman_rho: 0.307\n24\t    domain_spearman_p: 0.02\n25\t    sanity_random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n26\t    temporal_ability_jaccard: 0.014\n27\t    n_models_temporal_ref: 1080\n28\t    n_models_temporal_foc: 807\n29\t    n_items: 12508\n30\t    domain_specificity_c_range: 20.7–48.4%\n31\t    domain_specificity_mean: 30.6\n32\t    negative_disc_items_pct: 15.4\n33\t    negative_disc_sensitivity: C% changes <0.5pp with/without negative-disc items\n34\t  result_rationale: 'best档下temporal cohort的31.3% C%是核心headline数字，已被多层robustness control确认。\n35\t    random split 0.18%证明非统计伪影。enrichment≈0.96与Li et al.标签的理论预期一致—— web-overlap是global\n36\t    exposure指标，DIF检测differential functioning，二者正交，enrichment≈1.0是预期结果。 ability split仅2.9%说明DIF确实捕获temporal信号而非能力差异。within-family\n37\t    Llama-2v3的61.3% 反映两代间巨大能力跳跃(d=-0.99)中的genuine item-level变化，而非伪影。domain相关ρ=0.307\n38\t    表明domain improvement有modest贡献但非主因——plan_019/plan_030进一步量化为≤7.6%。\n39\t\n40\t    '\n41\t  tables:\n42\t  - name: 'Table 1: Temporal DIF Summary (ETS C Classification)'\n43\t    columns:\n44\t    - cohort_definition\n45\t    - n_ref\n46\t    - n_foc\n47\t    - n_items\n48\t    - pct_A\n49\t    - pct_B\n50\t    - pct_C\n51\t    - enrichment_li\n52\t    - random_sanity_c_pct\n53\t    rows:\n54\t    - - temporal_2023v2024\n55\t      - 1080\n56\t      - 807\n57\t      - 12508\n58\t      - 52.4\n59\t      - 16.3\n60\t      - 31.3\n61\t      - 0.96\n62\t      - 0.18\n63\t    - - ability_quintile\n64\t      - 1044\n65\t      - 1044\n66\t      - 12508\n67\t      - 85.2\n68\t      - 11.9\n69\t      - 2.9\n70\t      - 1.19\n71\t      - 0.15\n72\t    - - within_family_llama\n73\t      - 161\n74\t      - 308\n75\t      - 12508\n76\t      - 24.1\n77\t      - 14.6\n78\t      - 61.3\n79\t      - 0.91\n80\t      - 0.22\n81\t  - name: 'Table 2: Domain-Specificity Top/Bottom 5 Subjects by C%'\n82\t    columns:\n83\t    - subject\n84\t    - n_items\n85\t    - pct_c\n86\t    - pct_favor_2024\n87\t    rows:\n88\t    - - business_ethics\n89\t      - 100\n90\t      - 48.4\n91\t      - 39.6\n92\t    - - human_aging\n93\t      - 223\n94\t      - 41.9\n95\t      - 38.7\n96\t    - - formal_logic\n97\t      - 126\n98\t      - 40.4\n99\t      - 42.1\n100\t    - - management\n101\t      - 103\n102\t      - 21.7\n103\t      - 44.2\n104\t    - - computer_security\n105\t      - 100\n106\t      - 20.7\n107\t      - 47.3\n108\t  figures_description:\n109\t  - 'Fig 1: Heatmap of 57 MMLU subjects × C% (rows) vs temporal direction (columns),\n110\t    按domain着色'\n111\t  - 'Fig 2: DIF flags overlap Venn diagram — temporal vs ability vs within-family，Jaccard=0.014'\n112\t  analysis: '31.3%作为primary estimate稳固。ability split的2.9%与temporal的31.3%形成鲜明对比， 直接排除\"models\n113\t    got better → inflated DIF\"的解释。within-family结果(61.3%) 虽然高，但因Llama-2v3能力差距极大(d=-0.99)，plan_027的matching分析已将genuine\n114\t    item-level DIF 锁定在~28-29%。domain分析的ρ=0.307(p=0.02)是honest reporting——plan_019的item-level\n115\t    decomposition将其降至≤2.4pp(7.6%)，是paper的关键robustness支撑。\n116\t\n117\t    '\n118\t- name: rl_robustness_validation\n119\t  plan_id: plan_002\n120\t  description: '验证DIF对reasoning-RL模型的鲁棒性。三组对比：SFT-only baseline、alignment-RL(DPO/ORPO,\n121\t    N=477)、 reasoning-RL(10-15个GRPO/PPO模型注入focal cohort)。DIF group-level稳定性 vs 传统detector\n122\t    model-level退化。\n123\t\n124\t    '\n125\t  expected_results:\n126\t    n_reasoning_rl_models: 13\n127\t    reasoning_rl_models_list: DeepSeek-R1-7B, DeepSeek-R1-32B, Qwen2.5-RL-7B, Qwen2.5-RL-14B,\n128\t      Qwen2.5-RL-32B, Marco-o1-7B, Skywork-OR1-8B, OpenThinker-7B, OpenThinker-32B,\n129\t      s1-32B, STILL-2-7B, Light-R1-7B, Bespoke-Stratos-7B\n130\t    sft_baseline_c_pct: 31.3\n131\t    alignment_rl_cohort_c_pct: 31.1\n132\t    reasoning_rl_mixed_cohort_c_pct: 30.8\n133\t    jaccard_sft_vs_alignment_rl: 0.94\n134\t    jaccard_sft_vs_reasoning_rl_mixed: 0.92\n135\t    jaccard_alignment_vs_reasoning_rl: 0.93\n136\t    dif_flag_retention_rate: 0.95\n137\t    bootstrap_ci_jaccard_sft_vs_rl:\n138\t    - 0.9\n139\t    - 0.96\n140\t    tost_equivalence_p: 0.003\n141\t    tost_equivalence_margin: 0.05\n142\t    traditional_mink_auroc_sft: 0.72\n143\t    traditional_mink_auroc_rl: 0.48\n144\t    traditional_constat_auroc_sft: 0.68\n145\t    traditional_constat_auroc_rl: 0.51\n146\t    auroc_drop_mink: 0.24\n147\t    auroc_drop_constat: 0.17\n148\t    delong_mink_p: 0.001\n149\t    delong_constat_p: 0.008\n150\t    partial_exploitation_power:\n151\t      p_04:\n152\t        dif_tpr: 0.42\n153\t        mink_auroc: 0.39\n154\t      p_06:\n155\t        dif_tpr: 0.61\n156\t        mink_auroc: 0.44\n157\t      p_08:\n158\t        dif_tpr: 0.78\n159\t        mink_auroc: 0.46\n160\t      p_10:\n161\t        dif_tpr: 0.91\n162\t        mink_auroc: 0.48\n163\t  result_rationale: 'best档下Jaccard≥0.90是关键指标。DIF是group-level方法，将13个RL模型加入807个focal\n164\t    cohort (占比1.6%)对MH统计量的影响微乎其微——MH条件化total score后，RL模型的memorization pattern 被ability\n165\t    matching吸收。C%从31.3%微降至30.8%是噪声范围内的正常波动。 传统detector的AUROC下降0.17-0.24反映Wang et al.论证的NLL\n166\t    gap contraction机制： GRPO/PPO训练使模型对所有选项的logit分布更平坦，破坏了Min-K%和ConStat依赖的 per-token\n167\t    surprise信号，但不影响DIF的item-level binary response pattern。 TOST equivalence test (margin=0.05,\n168\t    p=0.003)正式确认DIF retention非空结果。\n169\t\n170\t    '\n171\t  tables:\n172\t  - name: 'Table: DIF Stability Across Training Paradigms'\n173\t    columns:\n174\t    - cohort_composition\n175\t    - n_foc\n176\t    - c_pct\n177\t    - jaccard_vs_sft\n178\t    - bootstrap_ci_95\n179\t    rows:\n180\t    - - SFT-only (baseline)\n181\t      - 807\n182\t      - 31.3\n183\t      - —\n184\t      - —\n185\t    - - Alignment-RL (DPO/ORPO)\n186\t      - 477\n187\t      - 31.1\n188\t      - 0.94\n189\t      - '[0.92, 0.96]'\n190\t    - - SFT+Reasoning-RL mixed\n191\t      - 820\n192\t      - 30.8\n193\t      - 0.92\n194\t      - '[0.90, 0.96]'\n195\t  - name: 'Table: Traditional Detector Degradation on Reasoning-RL'\n196\t    columns:\n197\t    - detector\n198\t    - auroc_sft\n199\t    - auroc_rl\n200\t    - delta_auroc\n201\t    - delong_p\n202\t    rows:\n203\t    - - Min-K%\n204\t      - 0.72\n205\t      - 0.48\n206\t      - -0.24\n207\t      - 0.001\n208\t    - - ConStat\n209\t      - 0.68\n210\t      - 0.51\n211\t      - -0.17\n212\t      - 0.008\n213\t    - - DIF (group)\n214\t      - —\n215\t      - —\n216\t      - Jaccard=0.92\n217\t      - TOST p=0.003\n218\t  figures_description:\n219\t  - 'Fig: Partial exploitation power curve — DIF TPR vs Min-K% AUROC as function of\n220\t    exploitation rate p∈[0.4, 1.0]'\n221\t  - 'Fig: Jaccard stability bootstrap distribution (1000 resamples), vertical line\n222\t    at 0.90 threshold'\n223\t  analysis: 'best档核心结论：DIF的group-level design天然免疫于RL训练对individual model信号的扰动。 13个RL模型虽少但足够——DIF不需要N≥80个RL模型，只需focal\n224\t    cohort total N≥80且RL模型 混入后不改变group-level pattern。Jaccard=0.92超过0.90阈值，TOST正式排除degradation。\n225\t    传统detector的0.17-0.24 AUROC drop提供鲜明对比，强化DIF的methodological advantage叙事。 Caveat:\n226\t    N=13 reasoning-RL仍然underpowered for standalone claim，但作为robustness check足够。\n227\t\n228\t    '\n229\t- name: constat_perturbation_eval\n230\t  plan_id: plan_003a\n231\t  description: 'ConStat-style perturbation testing独立评估：200+ MMLU items的LLM paraphrase生成、\n232\t    原始vs重述性能对比、FDR-controlled detection、RL vs non-RL检测力对比。\n233\t\n234\t    '\n235\t  expected_results:\n236\t    n_items_paraphrased: 250\n237\t    n_models_tested: 50\n238\t    constat_detection_rate_non_rl: 0.38\n239\t    constat_detection_rate_alignment_rl: 0.31\n240\t    constat_detection_rate_reasoning_rl: 0.14\n241\t    fdr_threshold: 0.05\n242\t    constat_fpr: 0.048\n243\t    constat_tpr_delta_ge_06: 0.62\n244\t    constat_tpr_delta_ge_10: 0.41\n245\t    paraphrase_quality_semantic_sim: 0.91\n246\t    paraphrase_quality_difficulty_corr: 0.83\n247\t    rl_sensitivity_ratio: 0.37\n248\t  result_rationale: 'best档下ConStat在non-RL模型上表现中等(detection rate 38%)，因为perturbation\n249\t    testing 依赖模型对original vs paraphrased的response差异——contaminated模型在original上表现异常好。\n250\t    但reasoning-RL模型通过GRPO训练泛化了problem-solving能力(非verbatim memorization)， 使original\n251\t    vs paraphrased差异消失，detection rate降至14%。这为ensemble论证(DIF covers where ConStat fails)提供直接证据。FPR在0.05\n252\t    FDR控制下保持在0.048。 注意：此实验在paper framing中已标记为\"never executed, future work\"，best档下执行它\n253\t    是为了提供完整的baseline comparison数据。\n254\t\n255\t    '\n256\t  tables:\n257\t  - name: 'Table: ConStat Detection Power by Training Paradigm'\n258\t    columns:\n259\t    - paradigm\n260\t    - n_models\n261\t    - detection_rate\n262\t    - fpr\n263\t    - effect_size_threshold\n264\t    rows:\n265\t    - - SFT-only\n266\t      - 25\n267\t      - 0.38\n268\t      - 0.048\n269\t      - δ≥0.6\n270\t    - - Alignment-RL\n271\t      - 15\n272\t      - 0.31\n273\t      - 0.045\n274\t      - δ≥0.6\n275\t    - - Reasoning-RL\n276\t      - 10\n277\t      - 0.14\n278\t      - 0.051\n279\t      - δ≥0.6\n280\t  figures_description:\n281\t  - 'Fig: Detection rate vs effect size threshold for ConStat across training paradigms'\n282\t  analysis: 'ConStat的RL-sensitivity确认了DIF的structural advantage：DIF条件化ability后检测 item-level\n283\t    differential functioning，不依赖per-model perturbation response差异。 ConStat适合non-RL场景，DIF适合所有场景。此结果支撑\"DIF\n284\t    as primary, ConStat as complementary\"叙事。 但因paper已决定不执行此实验(scope control)，此数据仅作appendix/future\n285\t    work参考。\n286\t\n287\t    '\n288\t- name: dvd_generation_variance_eval\n289\t  plan_id: plan_003b\n290\t  description: 'DVD generation variance独立评估：10-15个开源模型、每item 50次temperature sampling、\n291\t    generation variance score计算、bimodal分布检测。\n292\t\n293\t    '\n294\t  expected_results:\n295\t    n_models: 12\n296\t    n_items_sampled: 500\n297\t    temperature: 0.8\n298\t    n_generations_per_item: 50\n299\t    dvd_detection_rate_verbatim: 0.22\n300\t    dvd_detection_rate_variant: 0.45\n301\t    dvd_fpr: 0.065\n302\t    bimodal_detection_rate: 0.33\n303\t    dvd_auroc_verbatim: 0.61\n304\t    dvd_auroc_variant: 0.74\n305\t    compute_hours: 68\n306\t  result_rationale: 'best档下DVD对variant contamination (非verbatim、通过paraphrase传播的)检测力最强(AUROC=0.74)，\n307\t    因为variant contamination导致模型在某些generation中复现memorized pattern、其他时候正常推理， 产生bimodal\n308\t    variance signature。对verbatim contamination反而较弱(AUROC=0.61)， 因为verbatim memorization导致consistently\n309\t    correct response，variance反而低。 这与DIF(检测任何形式的differential functioning)和ConStat(检测perturbation\n310\t    sensitivity) 形成互补覆盖。FPR 0.065略高于理想值但可接受。\n311\t\n312\t    '\n313\t  tables:\n314\t  - name: 'Table: DVD Detection Power by Contamination Type'\n315\t    columns:\n316\t    - contamination_type\n317\t    - auroc\n318\t    - detection_rate\n319\t    - fpr\n320\t    rows:\n321\t    - - verbatim\n322\t      - 0.61\n323\t      - 0.22\n324\t      - 0.065\n325\t    - - variant\n326\t      - 0.74\n327\t      - 0.45\n328\t      - 0.065\n329\t    - - none (clean)\n330\t      - —\n331\t      - —\n332\t      - 0.065\n333\t  figures_description:\n334\t  - 'Fig: Generation variance distribution — clean vs verbatim vs variant contaminated\n335\t    items'\n336\t  analysis: 'DVD填补DIF和ConStat的variant contamination检测空白。但GPU cost (68h)和detection\n337\t    rate 均不及DIF的zero-GPU设计。此实验与plan_003a一样在paper scope外(never executed)， best档下执行是为ensemble\n338\t    fusion提供完整输入。\n339\t\n340\t    '\n341\t- name: ensemble_fusion\n342\t  plan_id: plan_003c\n343\t  description: 'DIF + ConStat + DVD三信号融合：threshold校准、2-of-3 majority voting、weighted\n344\t    fusion、 ensemble覆盖分析、5-fold交叉验证。\n345\t\n346\t    '\n347\t  expected_results:\n348\t    ensemble_fpr_majority: 0.032\n349\t    ensemble_fpr_weighted: 0.028\n350\t    ensemble_tpr_majority_delta_14: 0.78\n351\t    ensemble_tpr_weighted_delta_14: 0.82\n352\t    coverage_dif_only: δ≥1.4, all training types\n353\t    coverage_constat_only: δ≥0.6, non-RL only\n354\t    coverage_dvd_only: variant contamination\n355\t    coverage_ensemble: δ≥0.6, all types including variant\n356\t    cv_weight_dif: 0.52\n357\t    cv_weight_constat: 0.28\n358\t    cv_weight_dvd: 0.2\n359\t    uniform_vs_optimized_auc_gap: 0.03\n360\t  result_rationale: 'best档下ensemble的FPR<0.05(远低于0.10阈值)因为2-of-3 majority voting天然抑制\n361\t    single-signal false positives。TPR=0.82(weighted)超过任何单一信号因为三个detector 覆盖不同contamination机制。DIF权重最高(0.52)反映其跨training-paradigm的一致性。\n362\t    uniform vs optimized差距仅0.03 AUC说明fusion对权重不敏感。 但此实验依赖plan_003a/b，且paper已明确dropped\n363\t    ensemble contribution。 best档下这是最佳情况的appendix material。\n364\t\n365\t    '\n366\t  tables:\n367\t  - name: 'Table: Ensemble vs Individual Detector Performance'\n368\t    columns:\n369\t    - method\n370\t    - tpr_at_fpr_05\n371\t    - auroc\n372\t    - coverage_type\n373\t    rows:\n374\t    - - DIF (MH)\n375\t      - 0.68\n376\t      - 0.87\n377\t      - group-level, all paradigms\n378\t    - - ConStat\n379\t      - 0.55\n380\t      - 0.76\n381\t      - model-level, non-RL\n382\t    - - DVD\n383\t      - 0.42\n384\t      - 0.71\n385\t      - model-level, variant\n386\t    - - Ensemble (majority)\n387\t      - 0.78\n388\t      - 0.91\n389\t      - all\n390\t    - - Ensemble (weighted)\n391\t      - 0.82\n392\t      - 0.93\n393\t      - all\n394\t  figures_description:\n395\t  - 'Fig: ROC curves — DIF, ConStat, DVD, Ensemble (majority), Ensemble (weighted)'\n396\t  analysis: 'Ensemble在best档下表现优异但对paper叙事非必要——DIF standalone已足够支撑三贡献结构。 此结果作为future\n397\t    work方向：若DIF + ConStat + DVD三线融合被证实，可升级为独立contribution。 当前paper wisely将此降为appendix/dropped。\n398\t\n399\t    '\n400\t- name: cross_benchmark_gsm8k\n401\t  plan_id: plan_004\n402\t  description: 'GSM8K上的DIF复制分析：temporal cohort DIF、semi-synthetic validation、GSM1K\n403\t    correlation。\n404\t\n405\t    '\n406\t  expected_results:\n407\t    step1_gsm8k_temporal_c_pct: 18.9\n408\t    step1_n_items: 1319\n409\t    step1_n_ref: 1017\n410\t    step1_n_foc: 804\n411\t    step1_sanity_c_pct: 0.3\n412\t    step1_standard_external_spearman: 0.926\n413\t    step2_standard_delta_tpr_p10: 0.818\n414\t    step2_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.517\n415\t    step3_n_models: 33\n416\t    step3_pearson_r: -0.478\n417\t    step3_pearson_p: 0.005\n418\t    step3_spearman_rho: -0.403\n419\t    step3_partial_r: -0.385\n420\t    step3_direction: NEGATIVE (opposite to contamination hypothesis)\n421\t    step3_robust_leave_one_out: true\n422\t  result_rationale: 'best档下GSM8K C%=18.9%低于MMLU的31.3%，因为GSM8K是单domain数学benchmark，\n423\t    items间能力维度同质性更高，DIF更多反映genuine capability gain而非item-specific instability。 semi-synthetic\n424\t    ΔTPR=+0.818(标准matching)证明framework可移植性——GSM8K的单domain结构 使matching variable(total\n425\t    score)与target items共线性更强，但仍能检测injected contamination。 GSM1K correlation r=-0.478(negative)是关键finding：DIF\n426\t    flags与contamination gap 反向关联，说明DIF在GSM8K上捕获的不是contamination而是capability-driven\n427\t    item functioning变化。 这是honest reporting——不利于\"DIF detects contamination\"叙事，但完美支撑\"DIF\n428\t    as diagnostic lens\" reframing。best档下此negative result被视为strength而非weakness。\n429\t\n430\t    '\n431\t  tables:\n432\t  - name: 'Table: GSM8K Three-Step Validation'\n433\t    columns:\n434\t    - step\n435\t    - metric\n436\t    - value\n437\t    - interpretation\n438\t    rows:\n439\t    - - Step 1\n440\t      - temporal_c_pct\n441\t      - 18.9%\n442\t      - Lower than MMLU, consistent with single-domain\n443\t    - - Step 1\n444\t      - sanity_c_pct\n445\t      - 0.3%\n446\t      - Well below temporal signal\n447\t    - - Step 2\n448\t      - delta_tpr_p10\n449\t      - '+0.818'\n450\t      - Framework portable to math benchmark\n451\t    - - Step 3\n452\t      - pearson_r\n453\t      - -0.478\n454\t      - DIF ≠ contamination on GSM8K\n455\t  figures_description:\n456\t  - 'Fig: GSM1K gap vs DIF-C count scatter (N=33 models), with Cook''s D outlier annotation'\n457\t  analysis: 'GSM8K结果在best档下完美服务于paper的reframed叙事：DIF是diagnostic tool而非contamination\n458\t    detector。 r=-0.478的negative correlation被明确demote为exploratory(N=33, CI wide)，不进入abstract/conclusion。\n459\t    semi-synthetic ΔTPR=+0.818是Claim 3(framework)的cross-benchmark replication支撑。\n460\t\n461\t    '\n462\t- name: bifactor_irt_equating_pilot\n463\t  plan_id: plan_005\n464\t  description: 'MMLU上的bifactor IRT equating pilot：general factor + 57 subject-specific\n465\t    factors拟合、 anchor item选择、fixed-parameter calibration、equated score equivalence验证。\n466\t\n467\t    '\n468\t  expected_results:\n469\t    bifactor_rmsea: 0.028\n470\t    bifactor_cfi: 0.91\n471\t    bifactor_tli: 0.89\n472\t    bifactor_srmr: 0.045\n473\t    general_factor_variance_explained: 0.31\n474\t    n_anchor_items_selected: 850\n475\t    anchor_stability_criterion: no DIF across cohorts, discrimination >0.5\n476\t    equated_rho: 0.97\n477\t    convergence_time_hours: 48\n478\t    convergence_issues: 3/57 subject factors had Heywood cases; fixed with constrained\n479\t      estimation\n480\t    practical_verdict: fit marginal but usable for equating pilot\n481\t  result_rationale: 'best档下bifactor模型拟合marginal(CFI=0.91, TLI=0.89略低于0.95标准)， 但这是预期结果——12,508\n482\t    items × 57 subjects的bifactor是极高维模型，MMLU的inherent multidimensionality(57 subjects\n483\t    covering distinct knowledge domains)使完美拟合不现实。 general factor仅解释31% variance确认MMLU\n484\t    fundamentally multidimensional。 equated score的ρ=0.97 > 0.95目标说明即使fit marginal，equating仍然workable。\n485\t    但registry显示plan_015(对应此计划)被killed——在best档下这意味着虽然结果positive， 但团队正确判断bifactor不是paper的core\n486\t    contribution，将其kill是scope control决策而非technical failure。\n487\t\n488\t    '\n489\t  tables:\n490\t  - name: 'Table: Bifactor IRT Fit Indices'\n491\t    columns:\n492\t    - index\n493\t    - value\n494\t    - threshold\n495\t    - verdict\n496\t    rows:\n497\t    - - RMSEA\n498\t      - 0.028\n499\t      - <0.06\n500\t      - PASS\n501\t    - - CFI\n502\t      - 0.91\n503\t      - '>0.95'\n504\t      - MARGINAL\n505\t    - - TLI\n506\t      - 0.89\n507\t      - '>0.95'\n508\t      - MARGINAL\n509\t    - - SRMR\n510\t      - 0.045\n511\t      - <0.08\n512\t      - PASS\n513\t    - - General factor ω\n514\t      - 0.31\n515\t      - '>0.50'\n516\t      - FAIL\n517\t  figures_description:\n518\t  - 'Fig: Scree plot — general factor + 57 subject factors eigenvalue distribution'\n519\t  analysis: 'Bifactor结果确认MMLU的multidimensionality是structural reality而非estimation artifact。\n520\t    general factor ω=0.31说明unidimensional IRT fundamentally misspecified for MMLU——\n521\t    这是Limitations section的直接输入。best档下此结果被correctly scoped为motivation for future multidimensional\n522\t    IRT work，不作为numbered contribution。plan_015被kill是正确决策。\n523\t\n524\t    '\n525\t- name: item_generation_calibration\n526\t  plan_id: plan_006\n527\t  description: 'DIF-flagged MMLU items的替换生成：LLM generation with construct constraints、\n528\t    student simulation校准、difficulty correlation评估。\n529\t\n530\t    '\n531\t  expected_results:\n532\t    n_items_generated: 500\n533\t    n_dif_items_targeted: 200\n534\t    prompt_difficulty_rho: 0.32\n535\t    simulation_difficulty_rho: 0.71\n536\t    cognitive_level_match_rate: 0.78\n537\t    subject_match_rate: 1.0\n538\t    holdout_validation_rho: 0.65\n539\t    generation_model: claude-3.5-sonnet\n540\t    student_simulation_model: arXiv 2601.09953 protocol\n541\t    calibration_rmse: 0.18\n542\t  result_rationale: 'best档下prompt-based difficulty targeting的ρ=0.32与文献报告(0.10-0.45)一致——\n543\t    LLM对item difficulty的直觉calibration有限。student simulation将其提升至ρ=0.71， 远好于prompt-only但仍低于target\n544\t    benchmark的0.75-0.82。holdout validation ρ=0.65 反映generalization gap。cognitive level\n545\t    matching 78%说明同subject同difficulty≠同cognitive demand。 best档下此结果支撑\"item generation\n546\t    is feasible but imperfect\"的honest assessment， 与paper scope control一致(此实验在framing中标记为below\n547\t    benchmarks, dropped)。\n548\t\n549\t    '\n550\t  tables:\n551\t  - name: 'Table: Item Generation Calibration Accuracy'\n552\t    columns:\n553\t    - method\n554\t    - difficulty_rho\n555\t    - cognitive_match\n556\t    - holdout_rho\n557\t    rows:\n558\t    - - Prompt-only targeting\n559\t      - 0.32\n560\t      - 0.65\n561\t      - 0.28\n562\t    - - Student simulation\n563\t      - 0.71\n564\t      - 0.78\n565\t      - 0.65\n566\t    - - Literature benchmark\n567\t      - 0.75-0.82\n568\t      - —\n569\t      - —\n570\t  figures_description:\n571\t  - 'Fig: Generated vs original item difficulty scatter — prompt-only vs simulation-calibrated'\n572\t  analysis: '此实验确认item generation作为standalone contribution不够成熟，正确dropped from main\n573\t    paper。 student simulation的0.71相关性是promising future direction但不足以支撑equating pipeline\n574\t    claim。\n575\t\n576\t    '\n577\t- name: cumulative_bayesian_dif\n578\t  plan_id: plan_007\n579\t  description: 'Sinharay et al. (2006) cumulative Bayesian DIF priors实现：4次successive\n580\t    benchmark administrations模拟、 累积evidence下的power improvement量化。\n581\t\n582\t    '\n583\t  expected_results:\n584\t    n_simulated_administrations: 4\n585\t    individual_admin_power_delta_10: 0.42\n586\t    cumulative_2admin_power_delta_10: 0.58\n587\t    cumulative_3admin_power_delta_10: 0.71\n588\t    cumulative_4admin_power_delta_10: 0.78\n589\t    individual_admin_power_delta_14: 0.68\n590\t    cumulative_3admin_power_delta_14: 0.85\n591\t    fpr_all_conditions: <0.055\n592\t    prior_shrinkage_effect: reduces false positives at small N by 40%\n593\t    bayes_factor_threshold: 10\n594\t    posterior_prob_threshold: 0.95\n595\t    simulation_n_items: 500\n596\t    simulation_n_models_per_admin: 200\n597\t  result_rationale: 'best档下cumulative power从单次0.42(δ=1.0)升至3次累积0.71，恰好达到target ~0.70。\n598\t    这符合Bayesian累积的理论预期——每次administration提供independent evidence， posterior precision按√n速率增长。对δ=1.4(paper的operational\n599\t    region)，3次累积达0.85 已经很强。prior shrinkage对small N场景尤其有价值——减少40% false positives。\n600\t    best档下此结果作为supplementary analysis(audit protocol的temporal monitoring组件)， 不进入main\n601\t    body。与paper framing一致：plan_007标记为P2 simulation-only, underdeveloped。\n602\t\n603\t    '\n604\t  tables:\n605\t  - name: 'Table: Cumulative Bayesian DIF Power by Administration Count'\n606\t    columns:\n607\t    - n_administrations\n608\t    - power_delta_10\n609\t    - power_delta_14\n610\t    - power_delta_16\n611\t    - fpr\n612\t    rows:\n613\t    - - 1\n614\t      - 0.42\n615\t      - 0.68\n616\t      - 0.72\n617\t      - 0.041\n618\t    - - 2\n619\t      - 0.58\n620\t      - 0.79\n621\t      - 0.84\n622\t      - 0.038\n623\t    - - 3\n624\t      - 0.71\n625\t      - 0.85\n626\t      - 0.9\n627\t      - 0.035\n628\t    - - 4\n629\t      - 0.78\n630\t      - 0.89\n631\t      - 0.93\n632\t      - 0.033\n633\t  figures_description:\n634\t  - 'Fig: Power accumulation curve across administrations for δ∈{0.8, 1.0, 1.4, 1.6}'\n635\t  analysis: 'Cumulative Bayesian framework为audit protocol的longitudinal monitoring提供理论基础：\n636\t    即使单次检测power有限(0.42 at δ=1.0)，3-4次累积后power接近0.80。 这直接支撑三tier audit protocol中的\"monitor\"层(C%<15)——低于action阈值的items\n637\t    可通过cumulative monitoring最终达到decision threshold。Appendix material。\n638\t\n639\t    '\n640\t- name: graceful_degradation_analysis\n641\t  plan_id: plan_008\n642\t  description: 'Progressive item replacement下的benchmark validity degradation分析： ranking\n643\t    stability、score reliability、construct coverage随replacement率的变化。\n644\t\n645\t    '\n646\t  expected_results:\n647\t    replacement_5pct:\n648\t      ranking_rho: 0.999\n649\t      reliability_alpha: 0.968\n650\t      construct_coverage: 0.98\n651\t    replacement_10pct:\n652\t      ranking_rho: 0.997\n653\t      reliability_alpha: 0.961\n654\t      construct_coverage: 0.96\n655\t    replacement_20pct:\n656\t      ranking_rho: 0.993\n657\t      reliability_alpha: 0.948\n658\t      construct_coverage: 0.93\n659\t    replacement_50pct:\n660\t      ranking_rho: 0.978\n661\t      reliability_alpha: 0.912\n662\t      construct_coverage: 0.85\n663\t    theoretical_bound_ranking: ρ ≥ 1 - 0.45r where r is replacement fraction\n664\t    theoretical_bound_reliability: α ≥ α₀(1 - 0.8r²)\n665\t    empirical_validation_rho_vs_bound: 0.994\n666\t  result_rationale: 'best档下graceful degradation非常温和——50%替换后ranking ρ仍然0.978。 这与plan_017/plan_032的发现一致：MMLU具有massive\n667\t    measurement redundancy (ρ≈0.997 在31% DIF item removal后)，说明12,508 items中存在大量redundant\n668\t    measurement。 reliability从0.97降至0.91(50%替换)反映alpha对item数量的敏感性，但仍在可接受范围。 construct\n669\t    coverage下降(0.85 at 50%)是最敏感的指标——某些subject的coverage在高替换率下 因item数量不足而退化。theoretical\n670\t    bound与empirical fit的高相关(0.994)说明degradation 是predictable和manageable的。best档下此结果支撑audit\n671\t    protocol的\"act\"层decision-making。\n672\t\n673\t    '\n674\t  tables:\n675\t  - name: 'Table: Benchmark Validity Metrics Under Progressive Replacement'\n676\t    columns:\n677\t    - replacement_pct\n678\t    - ranking_rho\n679\t    - reliability_alpha\n680\t    - construct_coverage\n681\t    rows:\n682\t    - - 0\n683\t      - 1.0\n684\t      - 0.972\n685\t      - 1.0\n686\t    - - 5\n687\t      - 0.999\n688\t      - 0.968\n689\t      - 0.98\n690\t    - - 10\n691\t      - 0.997\n692\t      - 0.961\n693\t      - 0.96\n694\t    - - 20\n695\t      - 0.993\n696\t      - 0.948\n697\t      - 0.93\n698\t    - - 31\n699\t      - 0.99\n700\t      - 0.935\n701\t      - 0.89\n702\t    - - 50\n703\t      - 0.978\n704\t      - 0.912\n705\t      - 0.85\n706\t  figures_description:\n707\t  - 'Fig: Three validity metrics vs replacement fraction, with theoretical bounds\n708\t    overlaid'\n709\t  analysis: 'Graceful degradation结果直接支撑\"instability ≠ invalidity\"核心叙事： 即使替换31% DIF\n710\t    items，所有validity metrics仍在可接受范围内。 这与plan_017的ρ=0.996-0.999完全一致。对paper的audit protocol提供quantitative\n711\t    backing： benchmark maintainers可以confidently替换C-flagged items而不担心validity collapse。\n712\t\n713\t    '\n714\t- name: item_focused_trees\n715\t  plan_id: plan_009\n716\t  description: 'Item-Focused Trees (Tutz & Berger, 2016) 实现：以model release date为continuous\n717\t    covariate 替代categorical cohort split的DIF检测，与MH categorical DIF的对比。\n718\t\n719\t    '\n720\t  expected_results:\n721\t    n_items_analyzed: 12508\n722\t    ift_dif_detection_rate: 0.34\n723\t    ift_mh_concordance: 0.88\n724\t    ift_unique_detections: 412\n725\t    mh_unique_detections: 287\n726\t    ift_continuous_advantage: detects gradual drift missed by binary split\n727\t    ift_vs_mh_jaccard: 0.81\n728\t    ift_nonlinear_items: 856\n729\t    ift_split_point_mode: 2023-Q4\n730\t    computation_time_hours: 8\n731\t    cross_validation_stability: 0.91\n732\t  result_rationale: 'best档下IFT detection rate 34%略高于MH的31.3%，因为continuous treatment\n733\t    of release date 捕获了binary split遗漏的gradual drift items——某些items的difficulty在2023-Q3开始\n734\t    渐变而非在2023/2024 boundary突变。concordance 0.88和Jaccard 0.81说明两种方法 大量overlap但各有unique\n735\t    detections。IFT的split point mode在2023-Q4与temporal cohort boundary一致，验证了categorical\n736\t    split的reasonable choice。 856个nonlinear items(difficulty随时间非单调变化)是IFT独有的insight——\n737\t    binary DIF无法捕获\"先变难后变容易\"的pattern。 best档下此结果作为robustness check强化Claim 1：continuous\n738\t    method也给出~30%+ instability。\n739\t\n740\t    '\n741\t  tables:\n742\t  - name: 'Table: IFT vs MH-DIF Detection Comparison'\n743\t    columns:\n744\t    - method\n745\t    - detection_rate\n746\t    - unique_items\n747\t    - computation_hours\n748\t    rows:\n749\t    - - MH-DIF (categorical)\n750\t      - 31.3%\n751\t      - 287\n752\t      - 0.5\n753\t    - - IFT (continuous)\n754\t      - 34.0%\n755\t      - 412\n756\t      - 8.0\n757\t    - - Overlap (both)\n758\t      - —\n759\t      - Jaccard=0.81\n760\t      - —\n761\t  figures_description:\n762\t  - 'Fig: IFT split point distribution across items — histogram of optimal temporal\n763\t    cut points'\n764\t  - 'Fig: Example items showing gradual vs abrupt DIF, with IFT tree structure'\n765\t  analysis: 'IFT as robustness check完美服务best档叙事：不同方法学(continuous vs categorical) converge\n766\t    on same ~30%+ instability finding。IFT的8h computation vs MH的0.5h说明 MH作为primary\n767\t    method的practical advantage。nonlinear items是interesting supplementary finding 但不改变main\n768\t    conclusion。Paper placement: appendix robustness check。\n769\t\n770\t    '\n771\t- name: architecture_stratified_dif\n772\t  plan_id: plan_010\n773\t  description: 'Architecture-homogeneous subpopulation内的DIF分析：decoder-only only subset、\n774\t    IRT fit diagnostics、homogeneous vs full population DIF比较。\n775\t\n776\t    '\n777\t  expected_results:\n778\t    n_decoder_only: 5226\n779\t    n_non_decoder: 1\n780\t    pct_decoder_only: 99.98\n781\t    full_population_c_pct: 31.3\n782\t    decoder_only_c_pct: 31.3\n783\t    jaccard_full_vs_decoder_only: 1.0\n784\t    rmsea_full: 0.031\n785\t    rmsea_decoder_only: 0.031\n786\t    cfi_full: 0.89\n787\t    cfi_decoder_only: 0.89\n788\t    irt_fit_change: negligible — removing 1 model changes nothing\n789\t    architecture_heterogeneity_verdict: non-issue for METABENCH MMLU\n790\t  result_rationale: 'best档下architecture stratification结果trivial——METABENCH MMLU中99.98%(5226/5227)\n791\t    是decoder-only，唯一的non-decoder模型移除后Jaccard=1.0，C%完全不变。 这是paper_framing中已记录的结果。IRT\n792\t    fit indices不变因为单个模型的移除对5227×12508 矩阵的统计量影响在numerical noise范围内。 best档下此结果是proactive\n793\t    defense against \"architecture heterogeneity inflates DIF\" reviewer concern的一行报告：METABENCH\n794\t    MMLU is architecturally homogeneous, concern is moot。\n795\t\n796\t    '\n797\t  tables:\n798\t  - name: 'Table: Architecture Stratification Impact'\n799\t    columns:\n800\t    - population\n801\t    - n_models\n802\t    - c_pct\n803\t    - jaccard_vs_full\n804\t    - rmsea\n805\t    rows:\n806\t    - - Full population\n807\t      - 5227\n808\t      - 31.3\n809\t      - —\n810\t      - 0.031\n811\t    - - Decoder-only only\n812\t      - 5226\n813\t      - 31.3\n814\t      - 1.0\n815\t      - 0.031\n816\t  figures_description:\n817\t  - 'Fig: (不需要——结果trivial，一句话报告即可)'\n818\t  analysis: '此实验在best档下是一行proactive defense。reviewer concern about architecture heterogeneity\n819\t    在METABENCH MMLU上empirically无意义。paper中作为脚注或inline报告而非独立subsection。\n820\t\n821\t    '\n822\t- name: semi_synthetic_contamination_validation\n823\t  plan_id: plan_011\n824\t  description: 'Real METABENCH response matrix上的known contamination injection：500\n825\t    clean items选择、 100-200 items注入synthetic contamination(incorrect→correct flipping)、\n826\t    controlled ground truth下的TPR/FPR测量、injection参数变化(prevalence, exploitation rate,\n827\t    focal group size)。\n828\t\n829\t    '\n830\t  expected_results:\n831\t    temporal_external_tpr_p0: 0.326\n832\t    temporal_external_tpr_p03: 0.548\n833\t    temporal_external_tpr_p05: 0.834\n834\t    temporal_external_tpr_p07: 0.99\n835\t    temporal_external_tpr_p10: 1.0\n836\t    temporal_external_fpr: 0.314\n837\t    temporal_external_delta_tpr_p05: 0.508\n838\t    temporal_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.674\n839\t    ability_external_tpr_p10: 0.8\n840\t    ability_external_fpr: 0.493\n841\t    standard_mh_fpr_inflation: 0.298→0.616 at p=1.0\n842\t    cross_subject_matching_fpr_stable: true\n843\t    dose_response_monotonic: true\n844\t    injection_n_items: 200\n845\t    clean_baseline_n_items: 500\n846\t  result_rationale: 'best档下semi-synthetic validation的核心是ΔTPR=+0.508 at p=0.5——这证明DIF能检测\n847\t    known differential contamination(注入的ground truth)。dose-response单调性(从p=0.3到p=1.0\n848\t    TPR单调上升)确认检测力与exploitation rate成正比，排除了random artifact。 baseline FPR=0.314反映temporal\n849\t    cohort的genuine item-level DIF(与plan_001的31.3%一致)， 而非false positives——这些\"false\"\n850\t    positives实际上是真实的temporal instability。 cross-subject matching的FPR stability(vs\n851\t    standard matching的inflation至0.616) 是Claim 3的关键贡献：matching variable contamination是subtle\n852\t    but critical methodological issue。 best档下这些数字完美支撑三贡献结构中的Claim 2(semi-synthetic\n853\t    proves DIF detects what web-overlap labels cannot capture)和Claim 3(cross-subject\n854\t    matching as reusable infrastructure)。\n855\t\n856\t    '\n857\t  tables:\n858\t  - name: 'Table: Semi-Synthetic Detection Power (Cross-Subject Matching)'\n859\t    columns:\n860\t    - exploitation_rate_p\n861\t    - tpr\n862\t    - delta_tpr\n863\t    - fpr\n864\t    - fpr_inflation\n865\t    rows:\n866\t    - - 0.0 (baseline)\n867\t      - 0.326\n868\t      - —\n869\t      - 0.314\n870\t      - 0.0\n871\t    - - 0.3\n872\t      - 0.548\n873\t      - 0.222\n874\t      - 0.314\n875\t      - 0.0\n876\t    - - 0.5\n877\t      - 0.834\n878\t      - 0.508\n879\t      - 0.314\n880\t      - 0.0\n881\t    - - 0.7\n882\t      - 0.99\n883\t      - 0.664\n884\t      - 0.314\n885\t      - 0.0\n886\t    - - 1.0\n887\t      - 1.0\n888\t      - 0.674\n889\t      - 0.314\n890\t      - 0.0\n891\t  - name: 'Table: Matching Strategy Comparison at p=1.0'\n892\t    columns:\n893\t    - matching\n894\t    - tpr\n895\t    - fpr\n896\t    - delta_fpr_vs_baseline\n897\t    rows:\n898\t    - - Standard (within-benchmark)\n899\t      - 1.0\n900\t      - 0.616\n901\t      - 0.298\n902\t    - - Cross-subject (external)\n903\t      - 1.0\n904\t      - 0.314\n905\t      - 0.0\n906\t  figures_description:\n907\t  - 'Fig: Dose-response curve — ΔTPR vs exploitation rate p, with 95% CI bands'\n908\t  - 'Fig: FPR comparison — standard vs cross-subject matching across injection levels'\n909\t  analysis: 'semi-synthetic validation是paper中load-bearing experiment之一。ΔTPR=+0.508是Claim\n910\t    2 的empirical anchor：如果DIF只检测\"noise\"，注入known contamination不应提升TPR。 cross-subject\n911\t    matching的ΔFPR=0.000(5个subjects全部)是Claim 3的practical innovation proof。 best档下此实验与plan_016(within-subject\n912\t    semi-synthetic)共同构成semi-synthetic framework 的完整validation story。\n913\t\n914\t    '\n915\t- name: multi_benchmark_temporal_dif\n916\t  plan_id: plan_028\n917\t  description: 'METABENCH中额外benchmark(ARC-Challenge, HellaSwag, WinoGrande, TruthfulQA)的\n918\t    temporal DIF分析，加上已完成的MMLU和GSM8K，共6个benchmark。\n919\t\n920\t    '\n921\t  expected_results:\n922\t    mmlu:\n923\t      n_items: 12508\n924\t      n_ref: 1080\n925\t      n_foc: 807\n926\t      pct_c: 31.3\n927\t      random_pct_c: 0.18\n928\t      bootstrap_ci_95:\n929\t      - 29.38\n930\t      - 38.05\n931\t    winogrande:\n932\t      n_items: 1267\n933\t      n_ref: 1017\n934\t      n_foc: 803\n935\t      pct_c: 30.3\n936\t      random_pct_c: 0.32\n937\t    truthfulqa:\n938\t      n_items: 817\n939\t      n_ref: 1080\n940\t      n_foc: 807\n941\t      pct_c: 29.7\n942\t      random_pct_c: 0.37\n943\t    arc:\n944\t      n_items: 1172\n945\t      n_ref: 1080\n946\t      n_foc: 807\n947\t      pct_c: 26.9\n948\t      random_pct_c: 0.6\n949\t    gsm8k:\n950\t      n_items: 1319\n951\t      n_ref: 1017\n952\t      n_foc: 804\n953\t      pct_c: 18.9\n954\t      random_pct_c: 0.3\n955\t    hellaswag:\n956\t      n_items: 10042\n957\t      n_ref: 1080\n958\t      n_foc: 807\n959\t      pct_c: 17.9\n960\t      random_pct_c: 0.28\n961\t    cross_benchmark_range: 17.9–31.3%\n962\t    all_random_controls_below_1pct: true\n963\t    min_enrichment_ratio_vs_random: 45\n964\t  result_rationale: 'best档下6 benchmark全部显示显著temporal DIF(17.9-31.3%)，所有random controls\n965\t    <1%。 C%的跨benchmark range反映benchmark结构差异：MMLU/WinoGrande/TruthfulQA(多domain/多题型)\n966\t    的C%较高(29-31%)因为item heterogeneity提供更多DIF机会； GSM8K/HellaSwag(单domain或特定task)较低(17-19%)因为items更同质，\n967\t    differential functioning更多被ability matching吸收。 ARC(26.9%)居中。enrichment ratio(vs\n968\t    random)最低45×说明temporal DIF在所有benchmark 上都far above chance。best档下6-benchmark consistency是Claim\n969\t    1 generalizability的核心证据， 直接回应\"only validated on MMLU\"的reviewer concern。\n970\t\n971\t    '\n972\t  tables:\n973\t  - name: 'Table: Cross-Benchmark Temporal DIF Summary'\n974\t    columns:\n975\t    - benchmark\n976\t    - n_items\n977\t    - n_ref\n978\t    - n_foc\n979\t    - pct_c\n980\t    - random_pct_c\n981\t    - ratio\n982\t    rows:\n983\t    - - MMLU\n984\t      - 12508\n985\t      - 1080\n986\t      - 807\n987\t      - 31.3\n988\t      - 0.18\n989\t      - 174×\n990\t    - - WinoGrande\n991\t      - 1267\n992\t      - 1017\n993\t      - 803\n994\t      - 30.3\n995\t      - 0.32\n996\t      - 95×\n997\t    - - TruthfulQA\n998\t      - 817\n999\t      - 1080\n1000\t      - 807\n1001\t      - 29.7\n1002\t      - 0.37\n1003\t      - 80×\n1004\t    - - ARC-Challenge\n1005\t      - 1172\n1006\t      - 1080\n1007\t      - 807\n1008\t      - 26.9\n1009\t      - 0.6\n1010\t      - 45×\n1011\t    - - GSM8K\n1012\t      - 1319\n1013\t      - 1017\n1014\t      - 804\n1015\t      - 18.9\n1016\t      - 0.3\n1017\t      - 63×\n1018\t    - - HellaSwag\n1019\t      - 10042\n1020\t      - 1080\n1021\t      - 807\n1022\t      - 17.9\n1023\t      - 0.28\n1024\t      - 64×\n1025\t  figures_description:\n1026\t  - 'Fig: Bar chart of C% across 6 benchmarks, with random control overlay and 95%\n1027\t    bootstrap CIs'\n1028\t  analysis: '6-benchmark consistency(全部>15%、全部random<1%)是best档的strongest generalizability\n1029\t    evidence。 range 17.9-31.3%在best档key metrics范围内(cross_benchmark_c_pct_min 17-20%,\n1030\t    max 29-33%)。 此结果被审稿人视为充分跨benchmark证据，不需要additional benchmarks。\n1031\t\n1032\t    '\n1033\t- name: permutation_null_c_rate\n1034\t  plan_id: plan_029\n1035\t  description: '1000× permutation test：随机重分配2023/2024 temporal labels(保持group sizes\n1036\t    N_ref=1080, N_foc=807)，每次运行MH-DIF，建立C%的null distribution。\n1037\t\n1038\t    '\n1039\t  expected_results:\n1040\t    n_permutations: 1000\n1041\t    null_c_pct_mean: 0.21\n1042\t    null_c_pct_sd: 0.05\n1043\t    null_c_pct_max: 0.42\n1044\t    null_c_pct_p95: 0.3\n1045\t    null_c_pct_p99: 0.36\n1046\t    observed_c_pct: 31.3\n1047\t    permutation_p_value: <0.001\n1048\t    z_score_observed_vs_null: '>600'\n1049\t    null_distribution_shape: approximately normal, centered near random-split control\n1050\t    consistency_with_random_split: true\n1051\t    random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n1052\t    computation_time_hours: 12\n1053\t  result_rationale: 'best档下permutation null的mean C%=0.21%与within-cohort random split(0.18%)高度一致——\n1054\t    这是预期的，因为random label permutation破坏temporal信号后，MH-DIF只能检测到 random fluctuation，与random\n1055\t    split在概率上等价。null C% max=0.42%说明1000次permutation 中最极端的case也远低于observed 31.3%。z>600意味着observed值在null\n1056\t    distribution的 >600个标准差之外，permutation p<0.001(实际上是p<1/1000因为0/1000 permutations达到31.3%)。\n1057\t    best档下此结果直接回答\"is 31% above chance?\"——答案是overwhelming yes。 null distribution的near-normal\n1058\t    shape和consistency with random split互相验证了两种 null estimation方法的正确性。\n1059\t\n1060\t    '\n1061\t  tables:\n1062\t  - name: 'Table: Permutation Null Distribution Summary'\n1063\t    columns:\n1064\t    - statistic\n1065\t    - value\n1066\t    rows:\n1067\t    - - Observed C%\n1068\t      - 31.3\n1069\t    - - Null mean C%\n1070\t      - 0.21\n1071\t    - - Null SD\n1072\t      - 0.05\n1073\t    - - Null max (1000 perms)\n1074\t      - 0.42\n1075\t    - - Permutation p-value\n1076\t      - <0.001\n1077\t    - - z-score\n1078\t      - '>600'\n1079\t    - - Random-split control C%\n1080\t      - 0.18\n1081\t  figures_description:\n1082\t  - 'Fig: Null distribution histogram (1000 permutations) with observed 31.3% marked\n1083\t    as vertical red line, far off-scale'\n1084\t  analysis: 'Permutation null是Claim 1最直接的statistical significance evidence。 null mean\n1085\t    0.21%与random split 0.18%的一致性(差异0.03pp)说明两种null estimation converge。 observed 31.3%在null的>600σ之外——这不是marginal\n1086\t    significance，而是absolute certainty that temporal DIF is real。best档下审稿人无法质疑\"31%\n1087\t    is chance level\"。 此实验落在best档key metrics范围内(permutation_null_c_pct [0.0, 1.0])。\n1088\t\n1089\t    '\n1090\t- name: odds_ratio_regression_transparency\n1091\t  plan_id: plan_030\n1092\t  description: 'DIF flag的logistic regression透明度分析：odds ratio + 95% CI + 多种R²指标 + deviance\n1093\t    ratio。 item-level finer-grained model (DIF flag ~ item-level accuracy change)补充domain-level分析。\n1094\t\n1095\t    '\n1096\t  expected_results:\n1097\t    model1_domain_delta:\n1098\t      mcfadden_r2: 0.0007\n1099\t      nagelkerke_r2: 0.0012\n1100\t      subject_acc_delta_or_per_010: 1.55\n1101\t      subject_acc_delta_ci_per_010:\n1102\t      - 1.19\n1103\t      - 2.03\n1104\t    model2_domain_delta_plus_items:\n1105\t      mcfadden_r2: 0.0423\n1106\t      nagelkerke_r2: 0.072\n1107\t      subject_acc_delta_or_per_010: 0.73\n1108\t      ctt_discrimination_or_per_010: 1.51\n1109\t    model3_item_delta:\n1110\t      mcfadden_r2: 0.0012\n1111\t      nagelkerke_r2: 0.0021\n1112\t      item_acc_change_or_per_010: 1.08\n1113\t      item_acc_change_ci:\n1114\t      - 1.51\n1115\t      - 2.96\n1116\t    model4_item_delta_plus_items:\n1117\t      mcfadden_r2: 0.0434\n1118\t      nagelkerke_r2: 0.0737\n1119\t      item_acc_change_or_per_010: 0.92\n1120\t      ctt_discrimination_or_per_010: 1.54\n1121\t    simpsons_paradox: true\n1122\t    lr_test_m1_vs_m2_chi2: 646.98\n1123\t    lr_test_m3_vs_m4_chi2: 655.53\n1124\t  result_rationale: 'best档下四个模型的R²全部极低(<0.08)，这是core finding而非limitation： accuracy\n1125\t    change(无论domain-level还是item-level)解释DIF variance的能力极弱， 说明DIF捕获的是item-specific\n1126\t    differential functioning而非aggregate accuracy improvement。 Simpson''s paradox(Model\n1127\t    1中OR=1.55 per 0.10 accuracy change但Model 2/4中OR翻转至<1) 说明item properties(difficulty,\n1128\t    discrimination)是confounders——controlling后accuracy change 的apparent effect消失甚至反转。best档下此结果是plan_019(decomposition:\n1129\t    ≤2.4pp/7.6%) 的complementary evidence，用不同方法学(logistic regression vs item-level\n1130\t    decomposition) converge on same conclusion。discrimination OR=1.54最具信息量：high-discrimination\n1131\t    items 更容易被flag为DIF-C，因为它们对ability差异更敏感，微小的cohort composition差异就能触发large |Δ_MH|。\n1132\t\n1133\t    '\n1134\t  tables:\n1135\t  - name: 'Table: Logistic Regression Models for DIF Flag Prediction'\n1136\t    columns:\n1137\t    - model\n1138\t    - predictors\n1139\t    - mcfadden_r2\n1140\t    - nagelkerke_r2\n1141\t    - key_or\n1142\t    rows:\n1143\t    - - Model 1\n1144\t      - subject_acc_Δ\n1145\t      - 0.0007\n1146\t      - 0.0012\n1147\t      - 1.55 [1.19,2.03]\n1148\t    - - Model 2\n1149\t      - subject_acc_Δ + item_props\n1150\t      - 0.0423\n1151\t      - 0.072\n1152\t      - 0.73 (reversed)\n1153\t    - - Model 3\n1154\t      - item_acc_Δ\n1155\t      - 0.0012\n1156\t      - 0.0021\n1157\t      - 1.08 [1.51,2.96]\n1158\t    - - Model 4\n1159\t      - item_acc_Δ + item_props\n1160\t      - 0.0434\n1161\t      - 0.0737\n1162\t      - 0.92 (reversed)\n1163\t  figures_description:\n1164\t  - 'Fig: Simpson''s paradox visualization — marginal vs conditional OR for accuracy\n1165\t    change'\n1166\t  analysis: Simpson's paradox是this experiment的signature finding。Model 1作为primary(conservative,\n1167\t    gives accuracy change its best shot at explaining DIF)，Model 2作为supplementary\n1168\t    (shows the paradox)。审稿人看到R²<0.001 for accuracy change alone即可确信 \"31% is not just\n1169\t    models getting better\"。dual interpretation explicitly acknowledged in Discussion。\n1170\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"323cfb50-fdc2-4808-8997-11b497c1cdb0","uuid":"ab9d6322-e7df-4119-9d2b-702339d57397","timestamp":"2026-05-21T17:33:54.095Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0520_2/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T165710/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '原始framing完全成立。三贡献清晰：(1) 首次大规模temporal measurement drift实证发现，6个benchmark一致性证实泛化性；\n  (2) ground truth meta-critique改变领域对web-overlap验证的认知；(3) semi-synthetic + cross-subject\n  matching作为可复用基础设施。 ''31% instability robust to all controls''作为headline。DIF as diagnostic\n  lens + audit protocol提供actionable价值。无需调整claims强度。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: real_data_dif_mmlu\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: 'METABENCH MMLU response matrix (5,219 models × 12,508 items) 上的全量DIF分析。\n    temporal cohort (2023 vs 2024-H1)、ability-quintile split、within-family confound\n    control、domain-specificity分析。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    temporal_ets_c_pct: 31.3\n    temporal_fpr_li_clean: 0.318\n    temporal_enrichment: 0.96\n    ability_ets_c_pct: 2.9\n    ability_enrichment: 1.19\n    within_family_llama2v3_c_pct: 61.3\n    within_family_mistral_mixtral_c_pct: 38.7\n    domain_spearman_rho: 0.307\n    domain_spearman_p: 0.02\n    sanity_random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n    temporal_ability_jaccard: 0.014\n    n_models_temporal_ref: 1080\n    n_models_temporal_foc: 807\n    n_items: 12508\n    domain_specificity_c_range: 20.7–48.4%\n    domain_specificity_mean: 30.6\n    negative_disc_items_pct: 15.4\n    negative_disc_sensitivity: C% changes <0.5pp with/without negative-disc items\n  result_rationale: 'best档下temporal cohort的31.3% C%是核心headline数字，已被多层robustness control确认。\n    random split 0.18%证明非统计伪影。enrichment≈0.96与Li et al.标签的理论预期一致—— web-overlap是global\n    exposure指标，DIF检测differential functioning，二者正交，enrichment≈1.0是预期结果。 ability split仅2.9%说明DIF确实捕获temporal信号而非能力差异。within-family\n    Llama-2v3的61.3% 反映两代间巨大能力跳跃(d=-0.99)中的genuine item-level变化，而非伪影。domain相关ρ=0.307\n    表明domain improvement有modest贡献但非主因——plan_019/plan_030进一步量化为≤7.6%。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Temporal DIF Summary (ETS C Classification)'\n    columns:\n    - cohort_definition\n    - n_ref\n    - n_foc\n    - n_items\n    - pct_A\n    - pct_B\n    - pct_C\n    - enrichment_li\n    - random_sanity_c_pct\n    rows:\n    - - temporal_2023v2024\n      - 1080\n      - 807\n      - 12508\n      - 52.4\n      - 16.3\n      - 31.3\n      - 0.96\n      - 0.18\n    - - ability_quintile\n      - 1044\n      - 1044\n      - 12508\n      - 85.2\n      - 11.9\n      - 2.9\n      - 1.19\n      - 0.15\n    - - within_family_llama\n      - 161\n      - 308\n      - 12508\n      - 24.1\n      - 14.6\n      - 61.3\n      - 0.91\n      - 0.22\n  - name: 'Table 2: Domain-Specificity Top/Bottom 5 Subjects by C%'\n    columns:\n    - subject\n    - n_items\n    - pct_c\n    - pct_favor_2024\n    rows:\n    - - business_ethics\n      - 100\n      - 48.4\n      - 39.6\n    - - human_aging\n      - 223\n      - 41.9\n      - 38.7\n    - - formal_logic\n      - 126\n      - 40.4\n      - 42.1\n    - - management\n      - 103\n      - 21.7\n      - 44.2\n    - - computer_security\n      - 100\n      - 20.7\n      - 47.3\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 1: Heatmap of 57 MMLU subjects × C% (rows) vs temporal direction (columns),\n    按domain着色'\n  - 'Fig 2: DIF flags overlap Venn diagram — temporal vs ability vs within-family，Jaccard=0.014'\n  analysis: '31.3%作为primary estimate稳固。ability split的2.9%与temporal的31.3%形成鲜明对比， 直接排除\"models\n    got better → inflated DIF\"的解释。within-family结果(61.3%) 虽然高，但因Llama-2v3能力差距极大(d=-0.99)，plan_027的matching分析已将genuine\n    item-level DIF 锁定在~28-29%。domain分析的ρ=0.307(p=0.02)是honest reporting——plan_019的item-level\n    decomposition将其降至≤2.4pp(7.6%)，是paper的关键robustness支撑。\n\n    '\n- name: rl_robustness_validation\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '验证DIF对reasoning-RL模型的鲁棒性。三组对比：SFT-only baseline、alignment-RL(DPO/ORPO,\n    N=477)、 reasoning-RL(10-15个GRPO/PPO模型注入focal cohort)。DIF group-level稳定性 vs 传统detector\n    model-level退化。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_reasoning_rl_models: 13\n    reasoning_rl_models_list: DeepSeek-R1-7B, DeepSeek-R1-32B, Qwen2.5-RL-7B, Qwen2.5-RL-14B,\n      Qwen2.5-RL-32B, Marco-o1-7B, Skywork-OR1-8B, OpenThinker-7B, OpenThinker-32B,\n      s1-32B, STILL-2-7B, Light-R1-7B, Bespoke-Stratos-7B\n    sft_baseline_c_pct: 31.3\n    alignment_rl_cohort_c_pct: 31.1\n    reasoning_rl_mixed_cohort_c_pct: 30.8\n    jaccard_sft_vs_alignment_rl: 0.94\n    jaccard_sft_vs_reasoning_rl_mixed: 0.92\n    jaccard_alignment_vs_reasoning_rl: 0.93\n    dif_flag_retention_rate: 0.95\n    bootstrap_ci_jaccard_sft_vs_rl:\n    - 0.9\n    - 0.96\n    tost_equivalence_p: 0.003\n    tost_equivalence_margin: 0.05\n    traditional_mink_auroc_sft: 0.72\n    traditional_mink_auroc_rl: 0.48\n    traditional_constat_auroc_sft: 0.68\n    traditional_constat_auroc_rl: 0.51\n    auroc_drop_mink: 0.24\n    auroc_drop_constat: 0.17\n    delong_mink_p: 0.001\n    delong_constat_p: 0.008\n    partial_exploitation_power:\n      p_04:\n        dif_tpr: 0.42\n        mink_auroc: 0.39\n      p_06:\n        dif_tpr: 0.61\n        mink_auroc: 0.44\n      p_08:\n        dif_tpr: 0.78\n        mink_auroc: 0.46\n      p_10:\n        dif_tpr: 0.91\n        mink_auroc: 0.48\n  result_rationale: 'best档下Jaccard≥0.90是关键指标。DIF是group-level方法，将13个RL模型加入807个focal\n    cohort (占比1.6%)对MH统计量的影响微乎其微——MH条件化total score后，RL模型的memorization pattern 被ability\n    matching吸收。C%从31.3%微降至30.8%是噪声范围内的正常波动。 传统detector的AUROC下降0.17-0.24反映Wang et al.论证的NLL\n    gap contraction机制： GRPO/PPO训练使模型对所有选项的logit分布更平坦，破坏了Min-K%和ConStat依赖的 per-token\n    surprise信号，但不影响DIF的item-level binary response pattern。 TOST equivalence test (margin=0.05,\n    p=0.003)正式确认DIF retention非空结果。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: DIF Stability Across Training Paradigms'\n    columns:\n    - cohort_composition\n    - n_foc\n    - c_pct\n    - jaccard_vs_sft\n    - bootstrap_ci_95\n    rows:\n    - - SFT-only (baseline)\n      - 807\n      - 31.3\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - Alignment-RL (DPO/ORPO)\n      - 477\n      - 31.1\n      - 0.94\n      - '[0.92, 0.96]'\n    - - SFT+Reasoning-RL mixed\n      - 820\n      - 30.8\n      - 0.92\n      - '[0.90, 0.96]'\n  - name: 'Table: Traditional Detector Degradation on Reasoning-RL'\n    columns:\n    - detector\n    - auroc_sft\n    - auroc_rl\n    - delta_auroc\n    - delong_p\n    rows:\n    - - Min-K%\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.48\n      - -0.24\n      - 0.001\n    - - ConStat\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.51\n      - -0.17\n      - 0.008\n    - - DIF (group)\n      - —\n      - —\n      - Jaccard=0.92\n      - TOST p=0.003\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Partial exploitation power curve — DIF TPR vs Min-K% AUROC as function of\n    exploitation rate p∈[0.4, 1.0]'\n  - 'Fig: Jaccard stability bootstrap distribution (1000 resamples), vertical line\n    at 0.90 threshold'\n  analysis: 'best档核心结论：DIF的group-level design天然免疫于RL训练对individual model信号的扰动。 13个RL模型虽少但足够——DIF不需要N≥80个RL模型，只需focal\n    cohort total N≥80且RL模型 混入后不改变group-level pattern。Jaccard=0.92超过0.90阈值，TOST正式排除degradation。\n    传统detector的0.17-0.24 AUROC drop提供鲜明对比，强化DIF的methodological advantage叙事。 Caveat:\n    N=13 reasoning-RL仍然underpowered for standalone claim，但作为robustness check足够。\n\n    '\n- name: constat_perturbation_eval\n  plan_id: plan_003a\n  description: 'ConStat-style perturbation testing独立评估：200+ MMLU items的LLM paraphrase生成、\n    原始vs重述性能对比、FDR-controlled detection、RL vs non-RL检测力对比。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_items_paraphrased: 250\n    n_models_tested: 50\n    constat_detection_rate_non_rl: 0.38\n    constat_detection_rate_alignment_rl: 0.31\n    constat_detection_rate_reasoning_rl: 0.14\n    fdr_threshold: 0.05\n    constat_fpr: 0.048\n    constat_tpr_delta_ge_06: 0.62\n    constat_tpr_delta_ge_10: 0.41\n    paraphrase_quality_semantic_sim: 0.91\n    paraphrase_quality_difficulty_corr: 0.83\n    rl_sensitivity_ratio: 0.37\n  result_rationale: 'best档下ConStat在non-RL模型上表现中等(detection rate 38%)，因为perturbation\n    testing 依赖模型对original vs paraphrased的response差异——contaminated模型在original上表现异常好。\n    但reasoning-RL模型通过GRPO训练泛化了problem-solving能力(非verbatim memorization)， 使original\n    vs paraphrased差异消失，detection rate降至14%。这为ensemble论证(DIF covers where ConStat fails)提供直接证据。FPR在0.05\n    FDR控制下保持在0.048。 注意：此实验在paper framing中已标记为\"never executed, future work\"，best档下执行它\n    是为了提供完整的baseline comparison数据。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: ConStat Detection Power by Training Paradigm'\n    columns:\n    - paradigm\n    - n_models\n    - detection_rate\n    - fpr\n    - effect_size_threshold\n    rows:\n    - - SFT-only\n      - 25\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.048\n      - δ≥0.6\n    - - Alignment-RL\n      - 15\n      - 0.31\n      - 0.045\n      - δ≥0.6\n    - - Reasoning-RL\n      - 10\n      - 0.14\n      - 0.051\n      - δ≥0.6\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Detection rate vs effect size threshold for ConStat across training paradigms'\n  analysis: 'ConStat的RL-sensitivity确认了DIF的structural advantage：DIF条件化ability后检测 item-level\n    differential functioning，不依赖per-model perturbation response差异。 ConStat适合non-RL场景，DIF适合所有场景。此结果支撑\"DIF\n    as primary, ConStat as complementary\"叙事。 但因paper已决定不执行此实验(scope control)，此数据仅作appendix/future\n    work参考。\n\n    '\n- name: dvd_generation_variance_eval\n  plan_id: plan_003b\n  description: 'DVD generation variance独立评估：10-15个开源模型、每item 50次temperature sampling、\n    generation variance score计算、bimodal分布检测。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_models: 12\n    n_items_sampled: 500\n    temperature: 0.8\n    n_generations_per_item: 50\n    dvd_detection_rate_verbatim: 0.22\n    dvd_detection_rate_variant: 0.45\n    dvd_fpr: 0.065\n    bimodal_detection_rate: 0.33\n    dvd_auroc_verbatim: 0.61\n    dvd_auroc_variant: 0.74\n    compute_hours: 68\n  result_rationale: 'best档下DVD对variant contamination (非verbatim、通过paraphrase传播的)检测力最强(AUROC=0.74)，\n    因为variant contamination导致模型在某些generation中复现memorized pattern、其他时候正常推理， 产生bimodal\n    variance signature。对verbatim contamination反而较弱(AUROC=0.61)， 因为verbatim memorization导致consistently\n    correct response，variance反而低。 这与DIF(检测任何形式的differential functioning)和ConStat(检测perturbation\n    sensitivity) 形成互补覆盖。FPR 0.065略高于理想值但可接受。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: DVD Detection Power by Contamination Type'\n    columns:\n    - contamination_type\n    - auroc\n    - detection_rate\n    - fpr\n    rows:\n    - - verbatim\n      - 0.61\n      - 0.22\n      - 0.065\n    - - variant\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.45\n      - 0.065\n    - - none (clean)\n      - —\n      - —\n      - 0.065\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Generation variance distribution — clean vs verbatim vs variant contaminated\n    items'\n  analysis: 'DVD填补DIF和ConStat的variant contamination检测空白。但GPU cost (68h)和detection\n    rate 均不及DIF的zero-GPU设计。此实验与plan_003a一样在paper scope外(never executed)， best档下执行是为ensemble\n    fusion提供完整输入。\n\n    '\n- name: ensemble_fusion\n  plan_id: plan_003c\n  description: 'DIF + ConStat + DVD三信号融合：threshold校准、2-of-3 majority voting、weighted\n    fusion、 ensemble覆盖分析、5-fold交叉验证。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    ensemble_fpr_majority: 0.032\n    ensemble_fpr_weighted: 0.028\n    ensemble_tpr_majority_delta_14: 0.78\n    ensemble_tpr_weighted_delta_14: 0.82\n    coverage_dif_only: δ≥1.4, all training types\n    coverage_constat_only: δ≥0.6, non-RL only\n    coverage_dvd_only: variant contamination\n    coverage_ensemble: δ≥0.6, all types including variant\n    cv_weight_dif: 0.52\n    cv_weight_constat: 0.28\n    cv_weight_dvd: 0.2\n    uniform_vs_optimized_auc_gap: 0.03\n  result_rationale: 'best档下ensemble的FPR<0.05(远低于0.10阈值)因为2-of-3 majority voting天然抑制\n    single-signal false positives。TPR=0.82(weighted)超过任何单一信号因为三个detector 覆盖不同contamination机制。DIF权重最高(0.52)反映其跨training-paradigm的一致性。\n    uniform vs optimized差距仅0.03 AUC说明fusion对权重不敏感。 但此实验依赖plan_003a/b，且paper已明确dropped\n    ensemble contribution。 best档下这是最佳情况的appendix material。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Ensemble vs Individual Detector Performance'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - tpr_at_fpr_05\n    - auroc\n    - coverage_type\n    rows:\n    - - DIF (MH)\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.87\n      - group-level, all paradigms\n    - - ConStat\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.76\n      - model-level, non-RL\n    - - DVD\n      - 0.42\n      - 0.71\n      - model-level, variant\n    - - Ensemble (majority)\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.91\n      - all\n    - - Ensemble (weighted)\n      - 0.82\n      - 0.93\n      - all\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: ROC curves — DIF, ConStat, DVD, Ensemble (majority), Ensemble (weighted)'\n  analysis: 'Ensemble在best档下表现优异但对paper叙事非必要——DIF standalone已足够支撑三贡献结构。 此结果作为future\n    work方向：若DIF + ConStat + DVD三线融合被证实，可升级为独立contribution。 当前paper wisely将此降为appendix/dropped。\n\n    '\n- name: cross_benchmark_gsm8k\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: 'GSM8K上的DIF复制分析：temporal cohort DIF、semi-synthetic validation、GSM1K\n    correlation。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    step1_gsm8k_temporal_c_pct: 18.9\n    step1_n_items: 1319\n    step1_n_ref: 1017\n    step1_n_foc: 804\n    step1_sanity_c_pct: 0.3\n    step1_standard_external_spearman: 0.926\n    step2_standard_delta_tpr_p10: 0.818\n    step2_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.517\n    step3_n_models: 33\n    step3_pearson_r: -0.478\n    step3_pearson_p: 0.005\n    step3_spearman_rho: -0.403\n    step3_partial_r: -0.385\n    step3_direction: NEGATIVE (opposite to contamination hypothesis)\n    step3_robust_leave_one_out: true\n  result_rationale: 'best档下GSM8K C%=18.9%低于MMLU的31.3%，因为GSM8K是单domain数学benchmark，\n    items间能力维度同质性更高，DIF更多反映genuine capability gain而非item-specific instability。 semi-synthetic\n    ΔTPR=+0.818(标准matching)证明framework可移植性——GSM8K的单domain结构 使matching variable(total\n    score)与target items共线性更强，但仍能检测injected contamination。 GSM1K correlation r=-0.478(negative)是关键finding：DIF\n    flags与contamination gap 反向关联，说明DIF在GSM8K上捕获的不是contamination而是capability-driven\n    item functioning变化。 这是honest reporting——不利于\"DIF detects contamination\"叙事，但完美支撑\"DIF\n    as diagnostic lens\" reframing。best档下此negative result被视为strength而非weakness。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: GSM8K Three-Step Validation'\n    columns:\n    - step\n    - metric\n    - value\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Step 1\n      - temporal_c_pct\n      - 18.9%\n      - Lower than MMLU, consistent with single-domain\n    - - Step 1\n      - sanity_c_pct\n      - 0.3%\n      - Well below temporal signal\n    - - Step 2\n      - delta_tpr_p10\n      - '+0.818'\n      - Framework portable to math benchmark\n    - - Step 3\n      - pearson_r\n      - -0.478\n      - DIF ≠ contamination on GSM8K\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: GSM1K gap vs DIF-C count scatter (N=33 models), with Cook''s D outlier annotation'\n  analysis: 'GSM8K结果在best档下完美服务于paper的reframed叙事：DIF是diagnostic tool而非contamination\n    detector。 r=-0.478的negative correlation被明确demote为exploratory(N=33, CI wide)，不进入abstract/conclusion。\n    semi-synthetic ΔTPR=+0.818是Claim 3(framework)的cross-benchmark replication支撑。\n\n    '\n- name: bifactor_irt_equating_pilot\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: 'MMLU上的bifactor IRT equating pilot：general factor + 57 subject-specific\n    factors拟合、 anchor item选择、fixed-parameter calibration、equated score equivalence验证。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    bifactor_rmsea: 0.028\n    bifactor_cfi: 0.91\n    bifactor_tli: 0.89\n    bifactor_srmr: 0.045\n    general_factor_variance_explained: 0.31\n    n_anchor_items_selected: 850\n    anchor_stability_criterion: no DIF across cohorts, discrimination >0.5\n    equated_rho: 0.97\n    convergence_time_hours: 48\n    convergence_issues: 3/57 subject factors had Heywood cases; fixed with constrained\n      estimation\n    practical_verdict: fit marginal but usable for equating pilot\n  result_rationale: 'best档下bifactor模型拟合marginal(CFI=0.91, TLI=0.89略低于0.95标准)， 但这是预期结果——12,508\n    items × 57 subjects的bifactor是极高维模型，MMLU的inherent multidimensionality(57 subjects\n    covering distinct knowledge domains)使完美拟合不现实。 general factor仅解释31% variance确认MMLU\n    fundamentally multidimensional。 equated score的ρ=0.97 > 0.95目标说明即使fit marginal，equating仍然workable。\n    但registry显示plan_015(对应此计划)被killed——在best档下这意味着虽然结果positive， 但团队正确判断bifactor不是paper的core\n    contribution，将其kill是scope control决策而非technical failure。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Bifactor IRT Fit Indices'\n    columns:\n    - index\n    - value\n    - threshold\n    - verdict\n    rows:\n    - - RMSEA\n      - 0.028\n      - <0.06\n      - PASS\n    - - CFI\n      - 0.91\n      - '>0.95'\n      - MARGINAL\n    - - TLI\n      - 0.89\n      - '>0.95'\n      - MARGINAL\n    - - SRMR\n      - 0.045\n      - <0.08\n      - PASS\n    - - General factor ω\n      - 0.31\n      - '>0.50'\n      - FAIL\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Scree plot — general factor + 57 subject factors eigenvalue distribution'\n  analysis: 'Bifactor结果确认MMLU的multidimensionality是structural reality而非estimation artifact。\n    general factor ω=0.31说明unidimensional IRT fundamentally misspecified for MMLU——\n    这是Limitations section的直接输入。best档下此结果被correctly scoped为motivation for future multidimensional\n    IRT work，不作为numbered contribution。plan_015被kill是正确决策。\n\n    '\n- name: item_generation_calibration\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: 'DIF-flagged MMLU items的替换生成：LLM generation with construct constraints、\n    student simulation校准、difficulty correlation评估。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_items_generated: 500\n    n_dif_items_targeted: 200\n    prompt_difficulty_rho: 0.32\n    simulation_difficulty_rho: 0.71\n    cognitive_level_match_rate: 0.78\n    subject_match_rate: 1.0\n    holdout_validation_rho: 0.65\n    generation_model: claude-3.5-sonnet\n    student_simulation_model: arXiv 2601.09953 protocol\n    calibration_rmse: 0.18\n  result_rationale: 'best档下prompt-based difficulty targeting的ρ=0.32与文献报告(0.10-0.45)一致——\n    LLM对item difficulty的直觉calibration有限。student simulation将其提升至ρ=0.71， 远好于prompt-only但仍低于target\n    benchmark的0.75-0.82。holdout validation ρ=0.65 反映generalization gap。cognitive level\n    matching 78%说明同subject同difficulty≠同cognitive demand。 best档下此结果支撑\"item generation\n    is feasible but imperfect\"的honest assessment， 与paper scope control一致(此实验在framing中标记为below\n    benchmarks, dropped)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Item Generation Calibration Accuracy'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - difficulty_rho\n    - cognitive_match\n    - holdout_rho\n    rows:\n    - - Prompt-only targeting\n      - 0.32\n      - 0.65\n      - 0.28\n    - - Student simulation\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.65\n    - - Literature benchmark\n      - 0.75-0.82\n      - —\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Generated vs original item difficulty scatter — prompt-only vs simulation-calibrated'\n  analysis: '此实验确认item generation作为standalone contribution不够成熟，正确dropped from main\n    paper。 student simulation的0.71相关性是promising future direction但不足以支撑equating pipeline\n    claim。\n\n    '\n- name: cumulative_bayesian_dif\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: 'Sinharay et al. (2006) cumulative Bayesian DIF priors实现：4次successive\n    benchmark administrations模拟、 累积evidence下的power improvement量化。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_simulated_administrations: 4\n    individual_admin_power_delta_10: 0.42\n    cumulative_2admin_power_delta_10: 0.58\n    cumulative_3admin_power_delta_10: 0.71\n    cumulative_4admin_power_delta_10: 0.78\n    individual_admin_power_delta_14: 0.68\n    cumulative_3admin_power_delta_14: 0.85\n    fpr_all_conditions: <0.055\n    prior_shrinkage_effect: reduces false positives at small N by 40%\n    bayes_factor_threshold: 10\n    posterior_prob_threshold: 0.95\n    simulation_n_items: 500\n    simulation_n_models_per_admin: 200\n  result_rationale: 'best档下cumulative power从单次0.42(δ=1.0)升至3次累积0.71，恰好达到target ~0.70。\n    这符合Bayesian累积的理论预期——每次administration提供independent evidence， posterior precision按√n速率增长。对δ=1.4(paper的operational\n    region)，3次累积达0.85 已经很强。prior shrinkage对small N场景尤其有价值——减少40% false positives。\n    best档下此结果作为supplementary analysis(audit protocol的temporal monitoring组件)， 不进入main\n    body。与paper framing一致：plan_007标记为P2 simulation-only, underdeveloped。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cumulative Bayesian DIF Power by Administration Count'\n    columns:\n    - n_administrations\n    - power_delta_10\n    - power_delta_14\n    - power_delta_16\n    - fpr\n    rows:\n    - - 1\n      - 0.42\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.041\n    - - 2\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.84\n      - 0.038\n    - - 3\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.85\n      - 0.9\n      - 0.035\n    - - 4\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.89\n      - 0.93\n      - 0.033\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Power accumulation curve across administrations for δ∈{0.8, 1.0, 1.4, 1.6}'\n  analysis: 'Cumulative Bayesian framework为audit protocol的longitudinal monitoring提供理论基础：\n    即使单次检测power有限(0.42 at δ=1.0)，3-4次累积后power接近0.80。 这直接支撑三tier audit protocol中的\"monitor\"层(C%<15)——低于action阈值的items\n    可通过cumulative monitoring最终达到decision threshold。Appendix material。\n\n    '\n- name: graceful_degradation_analysis\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: 'Progressive item replacement下的benchmark validity degradation分析： ranking\n    stability、score reliability、construct coverage随replacement率的变化。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    replacement_5pct:\n      ranking_rho: 0.999\n      reliability_alpha: 0.968\n      construct_coverage: 0.98\n    replacement_10pct:\n      ranking_rho: 0.997\n      reliability_alpha: 0.961\n      construct_coverage: 0.96\n    replacement_20pct:\n      ranking_rho: 0.993\n      reliability_alpha: 0.948\n      construct_coverage: 0.93\n    replacement_50pct:\n      ranking_rho: 0.978\n      reliability_alpha: 0.912\n      construct_coverage: 0.85\n    theoretical_bound_ranking: ρ ≥ 1 - 0.45r where r is replacement fraction\n    theoretical_bound_reliability: α ≥ α₀(1 - 0.8r²)\n    empirical_validation_rho_vs_bound: 0.994\n  result_rationale: 'best档下graceful degradation非常温和——50%替换后ranking ρ仍然0.978。 这与plan_017/plan_032的发现一致：MMLU具有massive\n    measurement redundancy (ρ≈0.997 在31% DIF item removal后)，说明12,508 items中存在大量redundant\n    measurement。 reliability从0.97降至0.91(50%替换)反映alpha对item数量的敏感性，但仍在可接受范围。 construct\n    coverage下降(0.85 at 50%)是最敏感的指标——某些subject的coverage在高替换率下 因item数量不足而退化。theoretical\n    bound与empirical fit的高相关(0.994)说明degradation 是predictable和manageable的。best档下此结果支撑audit\n    protocol的\"act\"层decision-making。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Benchmark Validity Metrics Under Progressive Replacement'\n    columns:\n    - replacement_pct\n    - ranking_rho\n    - reliability_alpha\n    - construct_coverage\n    rows:\n    - - 0\n      - 1.0\n      - 0.972\n      - 1.0\n    - - 5\n      - 0.999\n      - 0.968\n      - 0.98\n    - - 10\n      - 0.997\n      - 0.961\n      - 0.96\n    - - 20\n      - 0.993\n      - 0.948\n      - 0.93\n    - - 31\n      - 0.99\n      - 0.935\n      - 0.89\n    - - 50\n      - 0.978\n      - 0.912\n      - 0.85\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Three validity metrics vs replacement fraction, with theoretical bounds\n    overlaid'\n  analysis: 'Graceful degradation结果直接支撑\"instability ≠ invalidity\"核心叙事： 即使替换31% DIF\n    items，所有validity metrics仍在可接受范围内。 这与plan_017的ρ=0.996-0.999完全一致。对paper的audit protocol提供quantitative\n    backing： benchmark maintainers可以confidently替换C-flagged items而不担心validity collapse。\n\n    '\n- name: item_focused_trees\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: 'Item-Focused Trees (Tutz & Berger, 2016) 实现：以model release date为continuous\n    covariate 替代categorical cohort split的DIF检测，与MH categorical DIF的对比。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_items_analyzed: 12508\n    ift_dif_detection_rate: 0.34\n    ift_mh_concordance: 0.88\n    ift_unique_detections: 412\n    mh_unique_detections: 287\n    ift_continuous_advantage: detects gradual drift missed by binary split\n    ift_vs_mh_jaccard: 0.81\n    ift_nonlinear_items: 856\n    ift_split_point_mode: 2023-Q4\n    computation_time_hours: 8\n    cross_validation_stability: 0.91\n  result_rationale: 'best档下IFT detection rate 34%略高于MH的31.3%，因为continuous treatment\n    of release date 捕获了binary split遗漏的gradual drift items——某些items的difficulty在2023-Q3开始\n    渐变而非在2023/2024 boundary突变。concordance 0.88和Jaccard 0.81说明两种方法 大量overlap但各有unique\n    detections。IFT的split point mode在2023-Q4与temporal cohort boundary一致，验证了categorical\n    split的reasonable choice。 856个nonlinear items(difficulty随时间非单调变化)是IFT独有的insight——\n    binary DIF无法捕获\"先变难后变容易\"的pattern。 best档下此结果作为robustness check强化Claim 1：continuous\n    method也给出~30%+ instability。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: IFT vs MH-DIF Detection Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - detection_rate\n    - unique_items\n    - computation_hours\n    rows:\n    - - MH-DIF (categorical)\n      - 31.3%\n      - 287\n      - 0.5\n    - - IFT (continuous)\n      - 34.0%\n      - 412\n      - 8.0\n    - - Overlap (both)\n      - —\n      - Jaccard=0.81\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: IFT split point distribution across items — histogram of optimal temporal\n    cut points'\n  - 'Fig: Example items showing gradual vs abrupt DIF, with IFT tree structure'\n  analysis: 'IFT as robustness check完美服务best档叙事：不同方法学(continuous vs categorical) converge\n    on same ~30%+ instability finding。IFT的8h computation vs MH的0.5h说明 MH作为primary\n    method的practical advantage。nonlinear items是interesting supplementary finding 但不改变main\n    conclusion。Paper placement: appendix robustness check。\n\n    '\n- name: architecture_stratified_dif\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: 'Architecture-homogeneous subpopulation内的DIF分析：decoder-only only subset、\n    IRT fit diagnostics、homogeneous vs full population DIF比较。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_decoder_only: 5226\n    n_non_decoder: 1\n    pct_decoder_only: 99.98\n    full_population_c_pct: 31.3\n    decoder_only_c_pct: 31.3\n    jaccard_full_vs_decoder_only: 1.0\n    rmsea_full: 0.031\n    rmsea_decoder_only: 0.031\n    cfi_full: 0.89\n    cfi_decoder_only: 0.89\n    irt_fit_change: negligible — removing 1 model changes nothing\n    architecture_heterogeneity_verdict: non-issue for METABENCH MMLU\n  result_rationale: 'best档下architecture stratification结果trivial——METABENCH MMLU中99.98%(5226/5227)\n    是decoder-only，唯一的non-decoder模型移除后Jaccard=1.0，C%完全不变。 这是paper_framing中已记录的结果。IRT\n    fit indices不变因为单个模型的移除对5227×12508 矩阵的统计量影响在numerical noise范围内。 best档下此结果是proactive\n    defense against \"architecture heterogeneity inflates DIF\" reviewer concern的一行报告：METABENCH\n    MMLU is architecturally homogeneous, concern is moot。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Architecture Stratification Impact'\n    columns:\n    - population\n    - n_models\n    - c_pct\n    - jaccard_vs_full\n    - rmsea\n    rows:\n    - - Full population\n      - 5227\n      - 31.3\n      - —\n      - 0.031\n    - - Decoder-only only\n      - 5226\n      - 31.3\n      - 1.0\n      - 0.031\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: (不需要——结果trivial，一句话报告即可)'\n  analysis: '此实验在best档下是一行proactive defense。reviewer concern about architecture heterogeneity\n    在METABENCH MMLU上empirically无意义。paper中作为脚注或inline报告而非独立subsection。\n\n    '\n- name: semi_synthetic_contamination_validation\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: 'Real METABENCH response matrix上的known contamination injection：500\n    clean items选择、 100-200 items注入synthetic contamination(incorrect→correct flipping)、\n    controlled ground truth下的TPR/FPR测量、injection参数变化(prevalence, exploitation rate,\n    focal group size)。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    temporal_external_tpr_p0: 0.326\n    temporal_external_tpr_p03: 0.548\n    temporal_external_tpr_p05: 0.834\n    temporal_external_tpr_p07: 0.99\n    temporal_external_tpr_p10: 1.0\n    temporal_external_fpr: 0.314\n    temporal_external_delta_tpr_p05: 0.508\n    temporal_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.674\n    ability_external_tpr_p10: 0.8\n    ability_external_fpr: 0.493\n    standard_mh_fpr_inflation: 0.298→0.616 at p=1.0\n    cross_subject_matching_fpr_stable: true\n    dose_response_monotonic: true\n    injection_n_items: 200\n    clean_baseline_n_items: 500\n  result_rationale: 'best档下semi-synthetic validation的核心是ΔTPR=+0.508 at p=0.5——这证明DIF能检测\n    known differential contamination(注入的ground truth)。dose-response单调性(从p=0.3到p=1.0\n    TPR单调上升)确认检测力与exploitation rate成正比，排除了random artifact。 baseline FPR=0.314反映temporal\n    cohort的genuine item-level DIF(与plan_001的31.3%一致)， 而非false positives——这些\"false\"\n    positives实际上是真实的temporal instability。 cross-subject matching的FPR stability(vs\n    standard matching的inflation至0.616) 是Claim 3的关键贡献：matching variable contamination是subtle\n    but critical methodological issue。 best档下这些数字完美支撑三贡献结构中的Claim 2(semi-synthetic\n    proves DIF detects what web-overlap labels cannot capture)和Claim 3(cross-subject\n    matching as reusable infrastructure)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Semi-Synthetic Detection Power (Cross-Subject Matching)'\n    columns:\n    - exploitation_rate_p\n    - tpr\n    - delta_tpr\n    - fpr\n    - fpr_inflation\n    rows:\n    - - 0.0 (baseline)\n      - 0.326\n      - —\n      - 0.314\n      - 0.0\n    - - 0.3\n      - 0.548\n      - 0.222\n      - 0.314\n      - 0.0\n    - - 0.5\n      - 0.834\n      - 0.508\n      - 0.314\n      - 0.0\n    - - 0.7\n      - 0.99\n      - 0.664\n      - 0.314\n      - 0.0\n    - - 1.0\n      - 1.0\n      - 0.674\n      - 0.314\n      - 0.0\n  - name: 'Table: Matching Strategy Comparison at p=1.0'\n    columns:\n    - matching\n    - tpr\n    - fpr\n    - delta_fpr_vs_baseline\n    rows:\n    - - Standard (within-benchmark)\n      - 1.0\n      - 0.616\n      - 0.298\n    - - Cross-subject (external)\n      - 1.0\n      - 0.314\n      - 0.0\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Dose-response curve — ΔTPR vs exploitation rate p, with 95% CI bands'\n  - 'Fig: FPR comparison — standard vs cross-subject matching across injection levels'\n  analysis: 'semi-synthetic validation是paper中load-bearing experiment之一。ΔTPR=+0.508是Claim\n    2 的empirical anchor：如果DIF只检测\"noise\"，注入known contamination不应提升TPR。 cross-subject\n    matching的ΔFPR=0.000(5个subjects全部)是Claim 3的practical innovation proof。 best档下此实验与plan_016(within-subject\n    semi-synthetic)共同构成semi-synthetic framework 的完整validation story。\n\n    '\n- name: multi_benchmark_temporal_dif\n  plan_id: plan_028\n  description: 'METABENCH中额外benchmark(ARC-Challenge, HellaSwag, WinoGrande, TruthfulQA)的\n    temporal DIF分析，加上已完成的MMLU和GSM8K，共6个benchmark。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    mmlu:\n      n_items: 12508\n      n_ref: 1080\n      n_foc: 807\n      pct_c: 31.3\n      random_pct_c: 0.18\n      bootstrap_ci_95:\n      - 29.38\n      - 38.05\n    winogrande:\n      n_items: 1267\n      n_ref: 1017\n      n_foc: 803\n      pct_c: 30.3\n      random_pct_c: 0.32\n    truthfulqa:\n      n_items: 817\n      n_ref: 1080\n      n_foc: 807\n      pct_c: 29.7\n      random_pct_c: 0.37\n    arc:\n      n_items: 1172\n      n_ref: 1080\n      n_foc: 807\n      pct_c: 26.9\n      random_pct_c: 0.6\n    gsm8k:\n      n_items: 1319\n      n_ref: 1017\n      n_foc: 804\n      pct_c: 18.9\n      random_pct_c: 0.3\n    hellaswag:\n      n_items: 10042\n      n_ref: 1080\n      n_foc: 807\n      pct_c: 17.9\n      random_pct_c: 0.28\n    cross_benchmark_range: 17.9–31.3%\n    all_random_controls_below_1pct: true\n    min_enrichment_ratio_vs_random: 45\n  result_rationale: 'best档下6 benchmark全部显示显著temporal DIF(17.9-31.3%)，所有random controls\n    <1%。 C%的跨benchmark range反映benchmark结构差异：MMLU/WinoGrande/TruthfulQA(多domain/多题型)\n    的C%较高(29-31%)因为item heterogeneity提供更多DIF机会； GSM8K/HellaSwag(单domain或特定task)较低(17-19%)因为items更同质，\n    differential functioning更多被ability matching吸收。 ARC(26.9%)居中。enrichment ratio(vs\n    random)最低45×说明temporal DIF在所有benchmark 上都far above chance。best档下6-benchmark consistency是Claim\n    1 generalizability的核心证据， 直接回应\"only validated on MMLU\"的reviewer concern。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cross-Benchmark Temporal DIF Summary'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - n_items\n    - n_ref\n    - n_foc\n    - pct_c\n    - random_pct_c\n    - ratio\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 12508\n      - 1080\n      - 807\n      - 31.3\n      - 0.18\n      - 174×\n    - - WinoGrande\n      - 1267\n      - 1017\n      - 803\n      - 30.3\n      - 0.32\n      - 95×\n    - - TruthfulQA\n      - 817\n      - 1080\n      - 807\n      - 29.7\n      - 0.37\n      - 80×\n    - - ARC-Challenge\n      - 1172\n      - 1080\n      - 807\n      - 26.9\n      - 0.6\n      - 45×\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 1319\n      - 1017\n      - 804\n      - 18.9\n      - 0.3\n      - 63×\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 10042\n      - 1080\n      - 807\n      - 17.9\n      - 0.28\n      - 64×\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Bar chart of C% across 6 benchmarks, with random control overlay and 95%\n    bootstrap CIs'\n  analysis: '6-benchmark consistency(全部>15%、全部random<1%)是best档的strongest generalizability\n    evidence。 range 17.9-31.3%在best档key metrics范围内(cross_benchmark_c_pct_min 17-20%,\n    max 29-33%)。 此结果被审稿人视为充分跨benchmark证据，不需要additional benchmarks。\n\n    '\n- name: permutation_null_c_rate\n  plan_id: plan_029\n  description: '1000× permutation test：随机重分配2023/2024 temporal labels(保持group sizes\n    N_ref=1080, N_foc=807)，每次运行MH-DIF，建立C%的null distribution。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_permutations: 1000\n    null_c_pct_mean: 0.21\n    null_c_pct_sd: 0.05\n    null_c_pct_max: 0.42\n    null_c_pct_p95: 0.3\n    null_c_pct_p99: 0.36\n    observed_c_pct: 31.3\n    permutation_p_value: <0.001\n    z_score_observed_vs_null: '>600'\n    null_distribution_shape: approximately normal, centered near random-split control\n    consistency_with_random_split: true\n    random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n    computation_time_hours: 12\n  result_rationale: 'best档下permutation null的mean C%=0.21%与within-cohort random split(0.18%)高度一致——\n    这是预期的，因为random label permutation破坏temporal信号后，MH-DIF只能检测到 random fluctuation，与random\n    split在概率上等价。null C% max=0.42%说明1000次permutation 中最极端的case也远低于observed 31.3%。z>600意味着observed值在null\n    distribution的 >600个标准差之外，permutation p<0.001(实际上是p<1/1000因为0/1000 permutations达到31.3%)。\n    best档下此结果直接回答\"is 31% above chance?\"——答案是overwhelming yes。 null distribution的near-normal\n    shape和consistency with random split互相验证了两种 null estimation方法的正确性。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Permutation Null Distribution Summary'\n    columns:\n    - statistic\n    - value\n    rows:\n    - - Observed C%\n      - 31.3\n    - - Null mean C%\n      - 0.21\n    - - Null SD\n      - 0.05\n    - - Null max (1000 perms)\n      - 0.42\n    - - Permutation p-value\n      - <0.001\n    - - z-score\n      - '>600'\n    - - Random-split control C%\n      - 0.18\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Null distribution histogram (1000 permutations) with observed 31.3% marked\n    as vertical red line, far off-scale'\n  analysis: 'Permutation null是Claim 1最直接的statistical significance evidence。 null mean\n    0.21%与random split 0.18%的一致性(差异0.03pp)说明两种null estimation converge。 observed 31.3%在null的>600σ之外——这不是marginal\n    significance，而是absolute certainty that temporal DIF is real。best档下审稿人无法质疑\"31%\n    is chance level\"。 此实验落在best档key metrics范围内(permutation_null_c_pct [0.0, 1.0])。\n\n    '\n- name: odds_ratio_regression_transparency\n  plan_id: plan_030\n  description: 'DIF flag的logistic regression透明度分析：odds ratio + 95% CI + 多种R²指标 + deviance\n    ratio。 item-level finer-grained model (DIF flag ~ item-level accuracy change)补充domain-level分析。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    model1_domain_delta:\n      mcfadden_r2: 0.0007\n      nagelkerke_r2: 0.0012\n      subject_acc_delta_or_per_010: 1.55\n      subject_acc_delta_ci_per_010:\n      - 1.19\n      - 2.03\n    model2_domain_delta_plus_items:\n      mcfadden_r2: 0.0423\n      nagelkerke_r2: 0.072\n      subject_acc_delta_or_per_010: 0.73\n      ctt_discrimination_or_per_010: 1.51\n    model3_item_delta:\n      mcfadden_r2: 0.0012\n      nagelkerke_r2: 0.0021\n      item_acc_change_or_per_010: 1.08\n      item_acc_change_ci:\n      - 1.51\n      - 2.96\n    model4_item_delta_plus_items:\n      mcfadden_r2: 0.0434\n      nagelkerke_r2: 0.0737\n      item_acc_change_or_per_010: 0.92\n      ctt_discrimination_or_per_010: 1.54\n    simpsons_paradox: true\n    lr_test_m1_vs_m2_chi2: 646.98\n    lr_test_m3_vs_m4_chi2: 655.53\n  result_rationale: 'best档下四个模型的R²全部极低(<0.08)，这是core finding而非limitation： accuracy\n    change(无论domain-level还是item-level)解释DIF variance的能力极弱， 说明DIF捕获的是item-specific\n    differential functioning而非aggregate accuracy improvement。 Simpson''s paradox(Model\n    1中OR=1.55 per 0.10 accuracy change但Model 2/4中OR翻转至<1) 说明item properties(difficulty,\n    discrimination)是confounders——controlling后accuracy change 的apparent effect消失甚至反转。best档下此结果是plan_019(decomposition:\n    ≤2.4pp/7.6%) 的complementary evidence，用不同方法学(logistic regression vs item-level\n    decomposition) converge on same conclusion。discrimination OR=1.54最具信息量：high-discrimination\n    items 更容易被flag为DIF-C，因为它们对ability差异更敏感，微小的cohort composition差异就能触发large |Δ_MH|。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Logistic Regression Models for DIF Flag Prediction'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - predictors\n    - mcfadden_r2\n    - nagelkerke_r2\n    - key_or\n    rows:\n    - - Model 1\n      - subject_acc_Δ\n      - 0.0007\n      - 0.0012\n      - 1.55 [1.19,2.03]\n    - - Model 2\n      - subject_acc_Δ + item_props\n      - 0.0423\n      - 0.072\n      - 0.73 (reversed)\n    - - Model 3\n      - item_acc_Δ\n      - 0.0012\n      - 0.0021\n      - 1.08 [1.51,2.96]\n    - - Model 4\n      - item_acc_Δ + item_props\n      - 0.0434\n      - 0.0737\n      - 0.92 (reversed)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Simpson''s paradox visualization — marginal vs conditional OR for accuracy\n    change'\n  analysis: Simpson's paradox是this experiment的signature finding。Model 1作为primary(conservative,\n    gives accuracy change its best shot at explaining DIF)，Model 2作为supplementary\n    (shows the paradox)。审稿人看到R²<0.001 for accuracy change alone即可确信 \"31% is not just\n    models getting better\"。dual interpretation explicitly acknowledged in Discussion。\n","numLines":1170,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1170}}}
